<title>JAPAN: Fuji Pharmaceutical -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Pharmaceutical -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.67		vs	    2.76</p>
<p> Operating	  389    million	  vs	  572    million</p>
<p> Current	    457    million	  vs	  667    million</p>
<p> Net		  270    million	  vs	  433    million</p>
<p> EPS		   18.49 yen	  vs	   29.60 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Pharmaceutical  Co Ltd focuses on hormone preparations, antibotics and circulatory drugs.</p>
</text>
